2
00:11:52,500 --> 00:11:58,500
All self-taught dancer Kate Parker has ever wanted to do was
perform with the American Academy of Ballet.

3
00:17:48,750 --> 00:17:54,750
But when she doesnt make it after auditioning, she learns that it takes more
than precision and perfection to succeed in the dance world.

