10
00:59:22,500 --> 00:59:28,500
Center Stage: Turn It Up is a 2008 dance drama film
and a sequel to Center Stage (2000).

11
01:05:18,750 --> 01:05:24,750
The film was directed by Steven Jacobson and written by Karen Bloch Morse.

12
01:11:15,000 --> 01:11:21,000
The film debuted on Oxygen on November 1, 2008.

13
01:17:11,250 --> 01:17:17,250
It stars Rachele Brooke Smith as Kate Parker and Kenny Wormald as Tommy Anderson, and also features Sarah Jayne Jensen as Suzanne Von Stroh,
with Peter Gallagher and Ethan Stiefel returning from the first film as Jonathan Reeves and Cooper Nielson, respectively.

14
01:23:07,500 --> 01:23:13,500
The film was followed by a sequel Center Stage: On Pointe (2016).

15
01:29:03,750 --> 01:29:09,750
The tone is emotional.
